// @falsified-by: tests/falsified/a-generic-struct-names-its-type-arguments.patch — interpret exit 1 -> 0, interpret expectations FAIL/1 -> 0/1 (the suite's verdict, not a count of matches), native exit 1 -> 0, native expectations FAIL/1 -> 0/1 (the suite's verdict, not a count of matches)
//   CHANNEL: expectations — the control refuses the `struct Box<T>` header instead.
